  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/618c595bd2f94942bd131e0a/step-c0335468.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn, finely chop tomato and cucumber and add to a medium bowl.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices (you should get 3 pieces per person).\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and remaining garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Transfer to a small bowl. Stir in yoghurt. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/618c595bd2f94942bd131e0a/step-e6f1e3fa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine haloumi, spicy taco seasoning (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When rice has 5 mins left, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi until browned, 1-2 mins each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/618c595bd2f94942bd131e0a/step-369e26ed.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To salsa, add a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season and toss.\n• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with haloumi and salsa.\n• Serve with garlic yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/618c595bd2f94942bd131e0a/step-7eeca47d.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
